      "text": "[中文](README.md)\n\nA [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) account-pool plugin that attaches **Codex, Grok, Claude, Cursor, Antigravity, and Kiro** subscriptions on Windows. A provider picker sits on the left of the composer."
